een\"><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-3\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-900 text-sm font-semibold text-ivory transition duration-300 group-hover:bg-brand-800\">G</div><div class=\"leading-none\"><p class=\"text-lg font-semibold tracking-[0.08em] text-brand-900\">好天使</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[9px] font-medium tracking-[0.22em] text-muted\">GOOD ANGEL</p></div></a><nav class=\"hidden items-center gap-8 lg:flex\"><a class=\"relative py-2 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-muted transition-colors duration-300 after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:h-px after:w-0 after:bg-gold after:transition-all after:duration-300 hover:text-brand-900 hover:after:w-full\" href=\"/\">首頁</a><a class=\"relative py-2 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-muted transition-colors duration-300 after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:h-px after:w-0 after:bg-gold after:transition-all after:duration-300 hover:text-brand-900 hover:after:w-full\" href=\"/about\">認識好天使</a><a class=\"relative py-2 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-muted transition-colors duration-300 after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:h-px after:w-0 after:bg-gold after:transition-all after:duration-300 hover:text-brand-900 hover:after:w-full\" href=\"/career\">加入好天使</a><a class=\"relative py-2 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-muted transition-colors duration-300 after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:h-px after:w-0 after:bg-gold after:transition-all after:duration-300 hover:text-brand-900 hover:after:w-full\" href=\"/team\">團隊文化</a><a class=\"relative py-2 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-muted transition-colors duration-300 after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:h-px after:w-0 after:bg-gold after:transition-all after:duration-300 hover:text-brand-900 hover:after:w-full\" href=\"/contact\">聯絡我們</a></nav><a class=\"hidden items-center gap-3 bg-brand-900 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-ivory transition duration-300 hover:bg-brand-800 lg:inline-flex\" href=\"/career\">加入我們<span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"開啟選單\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center border border-brand-900/20 text-brand-900 transition hover:bg-brand-900 hover:text-ivory lg:hidden\"><span class=\"text-lg leading-none\">☰</span></button></div></header><main><section class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-brand-900 pt-20 text-ivory\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0\"><div class=\"absolute left-[8%] top-0 h-full w-px bg-white/[0.05]\"></div><div class=\"absolute right-[8%] top-0 h-full w-px bg-white/[0.05]\"></div></div><div class=\"container-shell relative py-20 md:py-24 lg:py-28\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr] lg:gap-20\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-gold\"></span><p class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.28em] text-brand-200\">OUR PEOPLE</p></div></div><div><h1 class=\"max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.04em] text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl\">認識我們的團隊</h1><p class=\"mt-7 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-white/60 md:text-lg md:leading-9\">來自不同背景與專業領域的夥伴，在交流、協作與實務累積中彼此學習，一起建立屬於好天使的團隊文化。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"container-shell relative\"><div class=\"h-px bg-white/10\"></div></div></section><section id=\"team\" class=\"bg-ivory\"><div class=\"container-shell section-space\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.75fr_1.25fr] lg:gap-20\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-gold\"></span><p class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.25em] text-gold\">OUR PEOPLE</p></div><p class=\"mt-6 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">People · Knowledge · Collaboration</p></div><div><h2 class=\"max-w-4xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.35] tracking-[-0.03em] text-brand-900 md:text-5xl md:leading-[1.25]\">每一份專業背後，<br/>都是一群願意<span class=\"text-brand-600\"> 分享與同行的人。</span></h2><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-3xl text-base leading-8 text-muted md:text-lg\">好天使匯聚不同經驗與專業背景的夥伴。 我們相信，好的團隊不是每個人都一樣， 而是能讓不同能力彼此交流、互相學習，一起把事情做好。</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-16 grid gap-x-6 gap-y-14 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:gap-x-8\"><article class=\"group\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden bg-brand-100\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-600/50\">TEAM PHOTO</span></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-1/3 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand-900/20 to-transparent opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-5 right-5 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center border border-white/40 bg-white/10 text-sm text-white opacity-0 backdrop-blur-sm transition duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100\">↗</div></div><div class=\"border-b border-brand-900/15 pb-7 pt-6\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-5\"><div><p class=\"text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-gold\">不動產財商教育</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-brand-900\">創辦人</h3></div><span class=\"pt-1 text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] text-muted/50\">01</span></div><p class=\"mt-4 line-clamp-3 leading-7 text-muted\">...</p></div></article><article class=\"group\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden bg-brand-100\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-600/50\">TEAM PHOTO</span></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-1/3 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand-900/20 to-transparent opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-5 right-5 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center border border-white/40 bg-white/10 text-sm text-white opacity-0 backdrop-blur-sm transition duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100\">↗</div></div><div class=\"border-b border-brand-900/15 pb-7 pt-6\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-5\"><div><p class=\"text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-gold\">實務陪伴與學習支持</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-brand-900\">專業教練團隊</h3></div><span class=\"pt-1 text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] text-muted/50\">02</span></div><p class=\"mt-4 line-clamp-3 leading-7 text-muted\">...</p></div></article></div><div class=\"mt-24 border-t border-brand-900/15 pt-14 md:mt-32 md:pt-20\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr] lg:gap-20\"><div><p class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.25em] text-gold\">OUR CULTURE</p></div><div><h3 class=\"max-w-4xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.4] tracking-[-0.03em] text-brand-900 md:text-4xl\">專業不是一個人的表現，<br/><span class=\"text-brand-600\">而是一群人願意一起累積的結果。</span></h3><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-3xl leading-8 text-muted\">我們重視彼此分享經驗、交換觀點，也保留每個人發展自己專業方向的空間。 在這裡，學習不只是課程，而是每天與不同夥伴合作時持續發生的事情。</p></div></div></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"border-t border-white/10 bg-brand-900 text-ivory\"><div class=\"container-shell\"><div class=\"grid gap-12 py-14 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] md:items-start md:py-16\"><div><a class=\"inline-block\" href=\"/\"><p class=\"text-xl font-semibold tracking-[0.06em] text-white\">好天使</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.25em] text-white/40\">GOOD ANGEL</p></a><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-md text-sm leading-7 text-white/50\">結合不動產實務、財商教育與人才培育， 與願意學習、願意成長的夥伴一起累積專業。</p></div><nav class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-10 gap-y-4 sm:grid-cols-3 md:text-right\"><a class=\"text-sm text-white/55 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-brand-200\" href=\"/\">首頁</a><a class=\"text-sm text-white/55 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-brand-200\" href=\"/about\">認識好天使</a><a class=\"text-sm text-white/55 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-brand-200\" href=\"/career\">加入好天使</a><a class=\"text-sm text-white/55 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-brand-200\" href=\"/team\">團隊文化</a><a class=\"text-sm text-white/55 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-brand-200\" href=\"/contact\">聯絡我們</a></nav></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 border-t border-white/10 py-6 text-[11px] text-white/35 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\"><p>© 2026 好天使不動產財商團隊</p><p class=\"tracking-[0.16em]\">REAL ESTATE · FINANCE · GROWTH</p></div></div></footer><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3z5q_p4msz2ha.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[62319,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0hg8jbljd58u-.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\ne:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3udo72oo3to5n.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/797e433ab948586e-s.p.0r6juujl39pe6.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/caa3a2e1cccd8315-s.p.0wgildi0cnwt9.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"team\\\"],\\\"q\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"team\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{}]}]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",16],[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3udo72oo3to5n.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefi